WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.938
Welcome to the NI/Escalation SME orientation.

00:00:03.938 --> 00:00:07.725
Review National Interest domains and escalation evidence after the Macro

00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:09.262
dependency clears.

00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:12.688
Treat every queue item as a bounded specialist review.

00:00:12.688 --> 00:00:15.975
Confirm the source record and dependency state, inspect the

00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:20.025
complete worksheet or handoff, use the explicit specialist control

00:00:20.025 --> 00:00:22.663
, and verify the resulting queue state.

00:00:22.663 --> 00:00:25.250
Your decision becomes evidence for White Cell;

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.250
it does not replace White Cell’s operational role.
